    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_folding_set" kindref="compound">FoldingSet</ref> - This template class is used to instantiate a specialized implementation of the folding set to the node class T. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>T must be a subclass of <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a368e3de8ea854f34bc97c21a64d6a164" kindref="member">FoldingSetNode</ref> and implement a Profile function.</para>
<para>Note that this set type is movable and move-assignable. However, its moved-from state is not a valid state for anything other than move-assigning and destroying. This is primarily to enable movable APIs that incorporate these objects. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
